0	section	Starting off
1	line	Observatory professor	Hello.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Talk about the Observatory quest.
2	line	Player	Hi, I was...
2	line	Observatory professor	Welcome to the magnificent wonder of the Observatory, where wonder is all around you, where the stars can be clutched from the heavens!
2	line	Player	Wow, nice intro.
2	line	Observatory professor	Why, thanks! How might I help you?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	I'm totally lost.
3	line	Observatory professor	Lost? It must have been those pesky goblins that led you astray.
3	line	Observatory professor	Head north-east to find the city of Ardougne.
3	line	Player	I'm sure I'll find the way.
3	line	Player	Thanks for all your help.
3	line	Observatory professor	No problem at all. Come and visit again!
3	box	The professor carries on with his studies.
3	action	end
2	option	An Observatory?
3	line	Player	An Observatory?
3	line	Observatory professor	Of course. We have a superb telescope up in the Observatory, on the hill.
3	line	Observatory professor	A truly marvellous invention, the likes of which you'll never behold again.
3	line	Observatory assistant	Well, it would be if it worked.
3	line	Observatory professor	Don't interrupt!
3	line	Player	What? It doesn't work?
3	line	Observatory professor	Oh, no, no, no. Don't listen to him, he's joking. Aren't you, my FAITHFUL assistant?
3	line	Observatory assistant	Nope, dead serious. Hasn't been working for a long time.
3	line	Observatory professor	Arghhh! Get back to work and stop sticking your nose in!
3	line	Player	So, it's broken. How come?
3	line	Observatory professor	Oh, I suppose there's no use keeping it secret. Did you see those houses outside?
3	line	Player	Up on the hill? Yes, I've seen them.
3	line	Observatory professor	It's a horde of goblins.
3	line	Observatory professor	Since they moved here they have caused nothing but trouble.
3	line	Observatory professor	Last week, my telescope was tampered with.
3	line	Observatory professor	Now, parts need replacing before it can be used again. They've even been messing around in the dungeons under this area. Something needs to be done.
3	line	Observatory assistant	Strikes me that this visitor could help us.
3	line	Observatory professor	Stop being so rude.
3	line	Observatory professor	...
3	line	Observatory professor	Although, he has a point. What do you say?
3	line	Player	What, me?
3	select	Start the Observatory Quest?
3	option	Yes.
4	line	Player	Sounds interesting, what can I do for you?
4	line	Observatory professor	Oh, thanks so much.
4	line	Observatory professor	I shall need some materials for the telescope, so it can be used again.
4	line	Observatory professor	Let's start with three planks of wood for the telescope base. My assistant will help with obtaining these, won't you?
4	line	Observatory assistant	As if I don't have enough work to do. Seems I don't have a choice.
4	line	Observatory professor	Go talk to him if you need some advice.
4	line	Player	Okay, I'll be right back.
4	action	end
3	option	No.
4	line	Player	Oh, sorry, I don't have time for that.
4	line	Observatory professor	Oh dear. I really do need some help.
4	line	Observatory professor	If you see anyone who can help then please send them my way.
4	action	end
2	option	I'm just passing through.
3	line	Player	I'm just passing through.
3	line	Observatory professor	Fair enough. Not everyone is interested in this place, I suppose.
3	action	end
