1	line	Player	Where can I find planks of wood? I need some for the telescope's base.
1	line	Observatory assistant	I understand planks can be found at Port Khazard, to the east of here. There are some at the Barbarian Outpost, too.
1	line	Observatory assistant	Failing that, you could always ask the Sawmill Operator. He's to the north-east of Varrock, by the Lumber Yard.
