1	line	Observatory professor	Would you accompany me to the Observatory? You simply must see the telescope in operation.
1	line	Player	Sounds interesting. Count me in.
1	line	Observatory professor	Superb. You'll have to go via the dungeon under the goblin settlement, seeing as the bridge is broken. You'll find stairs up to the Observatory from there.
1	line	Player	Okay. See you there.
1	box	The professor has gone ahead to the Observatory dome. Best you follow him to see the finished telescope.
2	action	end
1	option	Talk about Treasure Trails.
0	section	Talking to the assistant before going up to the observatory
1	line	Player	Hello again.
1	line	Observatory assistant	Ah, it's the telescope repairman! The professor is waiting for you in the Observatory.
1	line	Player	How can I get to the Observatory?
1	line	Observatory assistant	Well, since the bridge was ruined, you will have to travel through the dungeon under the goblins' settlement.
1	action	end
0	section	Entering the observatory
1	box	~ The Observatory ~}} The great eye into the heavens.
1	line	Player	Hi, professor!
1	line	Observatory professor	Oh, hi there.
1	line	Observatory professor	I'm just adding the finishing touches.
1	line	Player	Okay, don't let me interrupt.
1	line	Observatory professor	Thank you.
1	line	Observatory professor	Right, let's get this finished.
1	line	Observatory professor	Hmmmm...
1	line	Observatory professor	Bit of a tap here...
1	line	Observatory professor	{player}, I'm just going upstairs to finish off.
1	line	Player	Right-oh.
1	line	Observatory professor	In goes the lens.
1	line	Observatory professor	Looking good.
1	line	Observatory professor	And one final adjustment.
1	line	Observatory professor	And all our work pays off.
0	section	Talking to the professor
1	line	Observatory professor	Welcome back.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Talk about the Observatory quest.
2	line	Player	Hi, this really is impressive.
2	line	Observatory professor	Certainly is. Please, take a look through the telescope and tell me what you see.
2	action	end
