1	line	Observatory professor	Welcome back.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Talk about the Observatory quest.
2	line	Player	I've had a look through the telescope.
2	line	Observatory professor	What did you see? If you're not sure, you can find out by looking at the star charts dotted around the walls downstairs.
2	line	Player	It was...
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Aquarius
3	line	Player	Aquarius!
3	action	If the player did see Aquarius:
4	line	Observatory professor	That's exactly it!
4	line	Player	Yes! Woo hoo!
4	action	If the player has inventory space for the reward:
5	line	Observatory professor	That's Aquarius, the water-bearer.
5	line	Observatory professor	It seems suitable, then, to award you with water runes!
5	line	Observatory professor	By Saradomin's earlobes! You must be a friend of the gods indeed.
5	line	Observatory professor	Look in your backpack for your reward, in payment for your work.
4	action	If the player does not have inventory space for the reward:
5	line	Observatory professor	Have you got some space for your reward?
5	line	Player	Reward? Oh, no, I haven't.
5	line	Observatory professor	Come see me again when you have a few free spaces in your inventory.
5	action	end
